---
/**
 * /kernel/policies/ — Policy editor (REPORTS-16).
 *
 * Features:
 * - Policy list with cards: name + status + last modified + edit + delete
 * - Visual rule builder in editor modal:
 *   - IF (PII type) [matches/contains] [pattern]
 *   - AND/OR (compliance pack) [in] [packs]
 *   - THEN (action) [mask/block/redact/log] + (risk modifier)
 * - Preview pane shows the equivalent JSON policy
 * - Save / Cancel buttons
 */
